c/engine/handle.py`**:\n  - [Lines 852-861, 871-879](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/handle.py#L852-L879): Captures initial `WitnessPosition` and calls `self._publish(snap, fact_cursor=fhead.rowid, tick_cursor=thead.rowid)`.\n  - [`_resolve_position`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/handle.py#L907-L917): Resolves `WitnessPosition` at current head fact id.\n  - [Lines 1256-1289, 1306-1341](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/handle.py#L1256-L1341): Advances witness positions and publishes updated `(fact_cursor, tick_cursor)` rowid pairs.\n\n- **`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py`**:\n  - [`_index_lines`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L860-L913): Tracks byte offset `end` and row counts `(facts, ticks)` when indexing JSONL log lines into SQLite.\n  - [`_stamp_meta`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L789-L808, #L975-L983): Records `jsonl_offset`, `jsonl_fact_count`, and `jsonl_tick_count`.\n\n- **`libs/store/src/store/rebirth.py`**:\n  - [`_chain_head`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/store/src/store/rebirth.py#L222-L237): Extracts chain head dictionary from `SELECT ... FROM ticks ORDER BY rowid DESC LIMIT 1`.\n  - [`rebirth`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/store/src/store/rebirth.py#L381-L437): Captures `chain_head` from source store, sets `source_chain_head` in birth certificate payload, and appends a genesis seal tick.\n\n- **`libs/store/src/store/jsonl.py`**:\n  - [`sqlite_to_jsonl`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/store/src/store/jsonl.py#L90-L130): Creates composite ordering coordinates `(fact_rowid, 1, 0)` for facts and `(anchor_fact_rowid, 2, tick_rowid)` for ticks based on `fact_cursor` resolution.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Where they are STORED\n\n- **SQLite `ticks` table colu