nes 212-230](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/canonical_audit.py#L212-L230): Validates stamped counts against `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM facts` and `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM ticks`.\n    - [Lines 259-289, 444-490](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/canonical_audit.py#L259-L289): Validates last log record matches last index row in `ORDER BY rowid DESC LIMIT 1`.\n  - [`audit_deep`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/canonical_audit.py#L292-L441):\n    - [Lines 337-375](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/canonical_audit.py#L337-L375): Verifies all indexed rows in `ORDER BY rowid` line-by-line against JSONL stream.\n    - [Lines 377-441](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/canonical_audit.py#L377-L441): Recomputes hash chain (`prev_hash`, `window_start`, `fact_cursor`, `window_hash`) from canonical log content.\n\n- **`libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py`**:\n  - [`verify_chain`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py#L1774-L1956):\n    - [Line 1856](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py#L1856): Fetches ticks in append order (`SELECT ... FROM ticks ORDER BY rowid`).\n    - [Lines 1867-1875](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py#L1867-L1875): Validates `prev_hash` linkage against prior row's computed hash.\n    - [Lines 1877-1897](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py#L1877-L1897): Validates `fact_cursor` continuity and verifies `_window_hash(window_start, fact_cursor)` against stored `window_hash`.\n    - [Lines 1937-1944](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py#L1937-L1944): Computes covered facts vs total facts in store.\n\n- **`libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py`**:\n  - [`receipt_group_span`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L206-L246): Validates whether a given `rowid` falls inside an atomic `_decl.*` receipt group via `SELECT rowid, ts, payload FROM facts WHERE kind GLOB '_decl.*' ORDER BY rowid`.\n  - [`verify_position_for_store`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L466-L517): Validates `at.store` and lineage match before applying a position's `rowid` to a store.\n  - [`diff_interval_report`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/witness.py#L570-L642): Queries `facts WHERE rowid \u003e ? AND rowid \u003c= ?` to check for out-of-order arrivals and declaration changes.\n\n- **`libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py`**:\n  - [`vertex_fold`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py#L1178-L1186, #L1227-L1261): Calls `verify_position_for_store(at, store_path)` and executes fold queries constrained by `WHERE rowid \u003c= at.rowid`.\n  - [`vertex_facts`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py#L1522-L1550): Calls `verify_position_for_store(at, store_path)` and filters `WHERE rowid \u003c= at.rowid`.\n\n- **`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py`**:\n  - [`_prefix_intact`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L827-L847): Reads `jsonl_offset`, `jsonl_fact_count`, `jsonl_tick_count` from `store_meta` and validates against log content at open/catch-up time.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Verbatim Quote of `libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py` lines 920-945\n\n```python\n920:         except _RowAlreadyIndexed as collision:\n921:             # The marker understates what the index consumed: a line the offset\n922:             # calls unindexed already has its row. Same class as the\n923:             # ``_prefix_intact`` failure one line up in ``catch_up`` 