/libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py#L481) — inside `vertex_reindex` (calls `_reindex_aggregate`)\n* [`libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py:545`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/vertex_reader.py#L545) — inside `_reindex_aggregate` (recursive call to `vertex_reindex`)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Data Source Read to Rebuild/Catch-Up the SQLite Index\n\n* **`ArrivalStore.catch_up`**:\n  * **Data source:** Reads from the **arrival log** (`.arrival` suffix via `ArrivalLog`).\n  * **Read lines:**\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py:253`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py#L253): `resumed, records = self._log.walk_marked(mark)`\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py:265`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py#L265): `for record, record_mark in records:`\n    * Read implementation in `ArrivalLog`: [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival.py:1229`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival.py#L1229) (`with self.path.open(\"rb\") as fh:`) and [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival.py:1238`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival.py#L1238) (`for raw in fh:`).\n\n* **`JsonlStore.catch_up` and `JsonlStore._rebuild`**:\n  * **Data source:** Reads from the **`.jsonl` file** (`self._log_path`).\n  * **Read lines:**\n    * Called via `_tail_forward` -\u003e `_index_lines` in catch-up ([`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:725`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L725), [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:919`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L919)), and via `_index_lines(0, 0, 0, rebuilding=True)` in `_rebuild` ([`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:963`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L963)).\n    * `_index_lines` iterates over `_read_lines`: [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:882`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L882): `for line, pos in self._read_lines(offset):`\n    * `_read_lines` opens and reads the `.jsonl` file:\n      * [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:859-862`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L859-L862):\n        ```python\n        with self._log_path.open(\"rb\") as fh:\n            fh.seek(offset)\n            pos = offset\n            for raw in fh:\n        ```\n\n* **`rebuild_jsonl`**:\n  * **Data source:** Reads from the **`.jsonl` source file**.\n  * **Read lines:**\n    * Validates log by reading `.jsonl` file: [`libs/store/src/store/jsonl.py:192-202`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/store/src/store/jsonl.py#L192-L202):\n      ```python\n      with source.open(\"rb\") as fh:\n          ...\n          for raw in fh:\n      ```\n    * Then delegates rebuild to `JsonlStore(path=target, log_path=source, ...)`: [`libs/store/src/store/jsonl.py:250-253`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/store/src/store/jsonl.py#L250-L253).\n\n---\n\n### 4. Code Paths Performing INSERT into SQLite Index Tables During Catch-Up/Rebuild\n\n* **In `ArrivalStore` during `catch_up`**:\n  * Dispatches each record through `_index_record`:\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py:266`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py#L266): `self._index_record(record)`\n  * Executes `INSERT INTO facts` / `INSERT INTO ticks`:\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py:296-298`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_store.py#L296-L298):\n      ```python\n      self._db.execute(\n          FACT_INSERT_SQL if t == \"fact\" else TICK_INSERT_SQL, row\n      )\n      ```\n  * SQL statements defined at:\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py:131`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py#L131): `FACT_INSERT_SQL = _insert_sql(\"facts\", FACT_COLUMNS)`\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py:132`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py#L132): `TICK_INSERT_SQL = _insert_sql(\"ticks\", TICK_COLUMNS)`\n\n* **In `JsonlStore` during `catch_up` and `_rebuild`**:\n  * Called from `catch_up` via `_tail_forward` -\u003e `_index_lines` ([`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:725`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L725), [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:919`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L919)).\n  * Called from `_rebuild` via `_index_lines(0, 0, 0, rebuilding=True)` ([`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:963`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L963)).\n  * Executes `INSERT INTO facts` / `INSERT INTO ticks` inside `_index_lines`:\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:889-891`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L889-L891):\n      ```python\n      self._conn.execute(\n          FACT_INSERT_SQL if t == \"fact\" else TICK_INSERT_SQL, row\n      )\n      ```\n  * Also updates/inserts metadata stamps in table `store_meta` via `_stamp` / `_meta_set`:\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:911`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L911): `self._stamp(end, base_facts + facts, base_ticks + ticks)`\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py:516`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/jsonl_store.py#L516): `self._meta_set(key, value)`\n    * [`libs/engine/src/engine/sqlite_store.py:476-479`](file:///private/tmp/claude-501/wt-sliceB-explore/libs/engine/src/engine/sq