   434	      verification lie, because the tick signature covers the chain fields.
   435	      The codec accepts all five as nullable — this is the pre-chain era
   436	      shape, honestly claimed.
   437	
   438	    There is no record-level signature. ``merge_store`` takes no signer and
   439	    never will: there is no key to sign with, and the target's operator holds
   440	    no key for a foreign observer anyway. The authorship claim that survives
